<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Tripnesia - Jelajah Keindahan Nusantara</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/trips.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-light">
  <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold" href="/">Tripnesia</a>
      <div>
        <% if (user) { %>
          <a href="/destinations" class="btn btn-outline-light me-2">Destinasi</a>
          <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-danger">Logout</a>
        <% } else { %>
          <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline-light me-2">Login</a>
          <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Register</a>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="section-top">
    <video class="section-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline>
      <source src="/borobudur.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      <source src="/bromocinema.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      <source src="/tmii.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <div class="section-overlay"></div>
    <div class="section-content text-center">
      <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">Selamat Datang di Tripnesia</h1>
      <p class="lead">Platform pemesanan tiket destinasi wisata terbaik dan terpercaya di Indonesia.</p>
      <a href="/destinations" class="btn btn-success btn-lg mt-3">Jelajahi Tempat Wisata</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-bottom">
    <div class="container py-5 text-white">
      <h2 class="text-center fw-bold mb-5">Kenapa Pilih Tripnesia?</h2>
      <div class="row text-center g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="p-4">
            <h3 class="mb-3">🔒</h3>
            <h5 class="fw-bold">Pembayaran Aman</h5>
            <p class="text-white-50">Transaksi kamu dijamin aman dengan sistem terpercaya dan terenkripsi.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="p-4">
            <h3 class="mb-3">🗺️</h3>
            <h5 class="fw-bold">Banyak Pilihan Destinasi</h5>
            <p class="text-white-50">Jelajahi destinasi wisata terbaik dari Sabang sampai Merauke.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="p-4">
            <h3 class="mb-3">🎟️</h3>
            <h5 class="fw-bold">E-Tiket Instan</h5>
            <p class="text-white-50">Tiket langsung terkirim ke email kamu setelah pembayaran berhasil.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>